          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "North Carolina's permitless-carry override did not get a vote this week; the next window is 30 November to 18 December.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "On Tuesday the NC House took up none of the four vetoed bills on its calendar, SB 50 among them; with 117 present, 70 votes were needed and the majority had 68. Current permit rules continue for now.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "color": "Warning",
            "text": "HOTTEST LEADS",
            "spacing": "Medium"
          },
          {
