            "color": "Warning",
            "text": "WHAT'S MOVING",
            "spacing": "Medium"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "text": "• NC: no SB 50 override vote; next window 30 Nov–18 Dec\n• Congress: Oversight hearing on ATF out-of-business records, 2pm ET\n• Texas: prefiled bills named (under-21, private sales, ERPO)\n• Gallup: 56% stricter, 27% as is, record 15% less strict",
